 the controls associated with this form, and is independent of the DOM (which is not modified). Multiple controls
 sharing the same name are each included as separate {@link Connection.KeyVal}s.
 <p>Controls are skipped when they are themselves disabled, or are inside a disabled {@code fieldset} &mdash;
